    doc="What a child teaches about animals (a fact such as \"a zebra can swim\", a pet such as \"my dog is called Rex\") and taking it back. The animals themselves and their facts (class, legs, diet and food, habitat, abilities, sound, covering, baby names) are the knowledge catalog's (k.animals), answered by the Talk tab's frames and read by the games by lookup; this world holds no knowledge base and no question pattern. Explicit no (refuted) is kept apart from unknown. Hand-built platform fixture, not produced by the C1 workflow."
